{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_stafff_01",
      "hash": "a8cdebfc51e7fa45",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "寶可夢塔是為了\\n撫慰死去的寶可夢\\r\\n而建成的塔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_middlef_01",
      "hash": "5f634170199b91b0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你也是來掃墓的嗎？\\n真是個對寶可夢\\r\\n很用心的男孩子啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_middlef_02",
      "hash": "5f634470199b96c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "妳也是來掃墓的嗎？\\n真是個對寶可夢\\r\\n很用心的女孩子啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_middlem_01",
      "hash": "697889aa44bc5e3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我忘不了\\n我那死去的皮皮……！\\c\\n……不好！\\n眼淚流出來了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_youngf_01",
      "hash": "92bb0cde9fc5d2ff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊啊……我的卡蒂狗……\\n你為什麼死掉了呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_shaman_01",
      "hash": "48e10c4c2057648f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是祈禱師！\\n我感覺到樓上\\r\\n有一縷迷途的靈魂。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_shaman_02",
      "hash": "48e10d4c20576642",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我先前感覺到的\\n樓上那一縷迷途的靈魂\\r\\n似乎已經消失了……！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t005r0301_max",
